  "description": "Host-agnostic, on-startup release-notification protocol: emails opted-in recipients when a\n      new MAJOR.MINOR release line ships. The host implements IReleaseAudience (recipients + a small\n      persistent key/value store); the library owns the notifier, idempotency, a persistent\n      stale-notes guard, and email rendering.",
